.UPDATE...
Issued at 907 AM PDT Sun Aug 9 2026

The marine layer has compressed to around 800 feet in depth this
morning per the OAK Upper Air Sounding. As such, will maintain
current Heat Advisory across the interior through 10 PM this
evening. With strong high pressure over the Desert Southwest,
still expecting today to be the warmest of the next 7 days. Will
need to evaluate late this morning and/or early afternoon whether
or not to cancel the Heat Advisory for portions of the region.

